Phase 7A migrates schema ownership to Flask-Migrate/Alembic.

Fresh database:
    flask --app run db upgrade

Existing Phase 6 SQLite database:
    1. Back up instance/hms.db.
    2. flask --app run db stamp 20260910_0001
    3. flask --app run db upgrade

Do not stamp an empty PostgreSQL database. Fresh PostgreSQL databases must run
`db upgrade` from the beginning so the baseline schema is created.
